            <div class="chart-container">
                <img src="data:image/png;base64,{charts['scatter_discount_rating']}" alt="Discount vs Rating Scatter">
            </div>
            <p><strong>Insight:</strong> The correlation between discount percentage and customer rating is <strong>{discount_rating_corr:.3f}</strong>, which is statistically negligible. This indicates that <em>deeper discounts do not correlate with higher customer satisfaction</em>. Customers rate based on product quality and utility, not simply the perceived "deal" they received.</p>
        </div>

