        </div>

        <!-- Review Sentiment Snapshot -->
        <div class="section" id="review-sentiment-snapshot">
            <h2>Review Sentiment Snapshot</h2>
            <p>A high-level qualitative overview of common positive and negative themes mentioned by customers in their reviews and titles.</p>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <img src="data:image/png;base64,{charts['sentiment']}" alt="Sentiment Keywords">
            </div>
            <p><strong>Insight:</strong> Positive sentiment heavily outweighs negative sentiment in raw volume. Value, quality ("good", "nice"), and performance ("great", "perfect") are the leading positive drivers. Negative sentiment primarily revolves around product failures ("bad", "poor", "waste", "defective").</p>
        </div>

